  "releaseNotes": "Lists: ListFieldDesignBase has a new ConfirmBeforePageChange setting (default true; ListField, DetailListField, TileListField and the external ListPagingField). With false the pager switches pages without the \"unsaved changes will be lost\" confirmation and the edits of the current page are discarded. It has no effect when IsInMemoryPaging is true, because that mode keeps the edits across pages and never asks.",
